      "en": "It shall be square and folded double; a span shall be its length, and a span its width.",
      "ko": "장광이 한뼘씩 두 겹으로 네모 반듯하게 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "616e58c33ae3a08aa6a75a0156826eb08bf97342d3f8e636b069770bfdd1b784",
      "translation_text_hash": "722f08d1993ab6541b60fa56a43571b01c4016585d8ee40a7dc00631c3e0e3c2",
